%I A398793 #10 Aug 23 2026 19:29:53
%S A398793 0,1,1,2,2,3,4,6,11,19,34,60,106,190,341,623,1148,2124,3963,7451,
%T A398793 14072,26699,50913,97379,186769,359164,692079,1336125,2583668,5002992,
%U A398793 9701007,18831364,36594031,71181933,138581314
%N A398793 Number of residues r mod 2^(n+1) such that r and r+1 have the same image and the same number of odd terms after n+1 iterations of the Collatz map (A014682) and such that r mod 2^n does not already have this property at level n.
%C A398793 Let f^(n) denote the n-th iteration of the Collatz map.
%C A398793 Nonnegative for all n: by Terras's theorem (1976) the first n parities of a trajectory depend only on the residue mod 2^n, and f^(n)(2^n*m + r) = 3^s*m + f^(n)(r), where s is the number of odd terms among the first n iterates of r. Taking m = 1 shows that if r is counted in A398792 at level n, then both r and r + 2^n are counted at level n+1, whence A398792(n+1) >= 2*A398792(n).
%C A398793 The pair (2^j - 2, 2^j - 1) merges for the first time at step j+2 for every even j >= 2, with merge point at the ternary repunit (3^(j-1)-1)/2, so new classes appear at infinitely many levels.
%C A398793 The ratio a(n+1)/a(n) increases toward 2 on the computed range (1.9469 at n = 35); whether its limit is 2 is equivalent to whether the density bound A398792(n)/2^n converges to the full density of consecutive pairs of equal Collatz height.
%C A398793 Relation to the 3x+1 problem: a(n) resolves A398792 level by level, counting the classes that first show this merging at level n+1; the class counted at n = 2 is Garner's pair (8m+4, 8m+5). Like A398792, the sequence is not evidence for or against the Collatz conjecture, since the map (3x-1)/2 gives the same values.
%H A398793 Omar Said, <a href="https://github.com/theswordofthemorning/zootheorem">Statements, proofs, sequence data and verification scripts</a>
%F A398793 a(n) = A398792(n+1) - 2*A398792(n).
%e A398793 a(2) = 1: the residue class r = 4 mod 8 (Garner's pair (8m+4, 8m+5)) merges at level 3 and is not the doubling of a class merging at level 2.
%Y A398793 Cf. A398792, A398794, A398795, A076227.
%K A398793 nonn,new
